# Every test runs under this repository's wrapper: the TEST_TMPDIR Bazel gives it as its TMPDIR and, for
# fixtures that bind a socket, a short private folder (macOS caps a unix socket path at 104 bytes and
# TEST_TMPDIR is longer than that leaves room for), both emptied when it ends, and the guard that
# refuses every program the test does not
# declare. A user bazelrc that sets another --run_under imports this file as its last line
# (docs/running-tests.md).
test --run_under=//tools:test_tmpdir
